      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We must reframe this debate not as an \"either/or\" choice, but as a balance of responsibilities. A government's duty to its own people is paramount, but providing foreign aid acknowledges that global stability is ultimately in *our* best interest. When crises abroad destabilize regions, they inevitably ripple across our own communities. Therefore, acting compassionately overseas is not abandoning domestic duty; it is a proactive investment in a safer, more stable world for everyone here at home.",
